==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Azumarill|35}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion; both cards have the Waterfall attack.
*{{m|Waterfall}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Azumarill}} can learn via [[TM]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

